Minimacy extension for Notepad++
--------------------------------

Setup
-----
Either:
- in Notepad++, menu Language > User Defined Language > Define your language...
- click Import... and select the file minimacyForNotepad++.xml
- restart Notepad++
Or:
- copy the file minimacyForNotepad++.xml into the directory %APPDATA%\Notepad++\userDefineLangs
- restart Notepad++

The .mcy files are then automatically highlighted.

Update
------
Before importing a new version, remove the previous one:
in the "Define your language" dialog, select "minimacy" in the "User language" list and click Remove.
